{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012_03_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6eeeaebee62f8757b3db0812e9f3c6a460de34f377fd47f9f521b3e187c0a4fb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bce9c58d61ba00612587a5af98cda571e77a2fcafc3a09657386de3cfb2549a",
      "text": "不，准确地说，是正打算要当。\n想要找一件适合试镜的惹眼的衣服～这样……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c2f88b591d25ecd5e5cfe7f415b8aef2e3cb5d487a9c51379173d547fb0274d",
      "text": "偶、偶像！？\n那……那不是正适合你的职业嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84f9ae6441cb841f37832d58ddf9e3dfaa36d4cf297b7d7d2e93e12858cad1f9",
      "text": "既然是这样的话，待会儿也顺便去去我朋友开的\n这家店吧。地点在……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5756ea3d2132dfa905b3dde57eea029b6f8093c911b118b176fc832ad9dc385",
      "text": "Hi☆ 经人介绍过来的……\n哎，你是那家伙的roommate啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40cf33c291fdca6c5d987ae4f179a49838d64c759ba3158b544bb39a79de8d11",
      "text": "而且你的friend也开了shop吗？\n也愿意介绍给我……谢谢你☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab81280c5de38e92bfee79d04e0baae8b863d1ec1e3747cfac8c14d66ab7752d",
      "text": "真的呢，这条皮带看起来style超棒！\n多亏了你的帮忙，帮大忙啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:370717103e914a0b3f52fc3ac9d68f119a70865f7bb1bf4ae5fc07dd231cfe86",
      "text": "既然是我friend的friend，\n那从今天起我们也是friend啦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0f2a86a83821a3be4f91baeca367d2a3255ecd7d2134fa2f44c63457fc499ef",
      "text": "（类这家伙，每到一个地方朋友就多一个。\n能跟任何人立刻打成一片，真是一种才能呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_03_1_1_012_03:1_1_012_03_c:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c108b2176f7b41170027a8e94daf78732c83b7172dd0047343ba5138195476b9",
      "text": "（说起来，刚作为新任教师调过来的时候也是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
